    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d524">

                <pb facs="0757" n="737" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg737"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 9, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to your note of the 13th
                    ultimo, relative to the steamer Mary, and her supposed connexion with the
                    southern insurgents, I have the honor to enclose copy of a despatch which I have
                    received on this subject from the lieutenant governor of Nova Scotia.</p>
                <p>I have the.honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c, &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d524-a1.xml" xpointer="d524-a1"/>
